            <description><![CDATA[

        <h2>ExtraDock 5.0.1-beta.6 – Take Control of Running Indicators! 🎯🎨</h2>

        <h3>✨ What's New</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>App-Wide Running Indicator Toggle:</strong> A new master switch in Settings → Behavior lets you show or hide the running-app dots across every dock at once — individual docks keep their own opt-out too!</li>
            <li><strong>Custom Indicator Color:</strong> Pick one color for running indicators across all your docks, or leave it on Default to keep each dock's accent color with the adaptive light/dark palette!</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>🚀 What's Next?</h3>
        <p>This beta continues polishing the first official V5 release — please report anything that still feels off!</p>

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><em>Thank you for helping test ExtraDock 5! Your feedback drives every improvement we make. 💙</em></p>
            ]]></description>

